---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | RewardPath Guide" description="Read the RewardPath Guide privacy policy and learn what information may be collected when you use this website.">
  <section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">TRANSPARENCY</span><h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1><p>Last updated: November 26, 2026</p><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={base}>Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="prose-page section-space"><div class="container prose-container"><p>This Privacy Policy describes the general approach for the RewardPath Guide website. Update this policy before adding analytics, advertising, affiliate tracking, embedded services, forms, or other tools that collect information.</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>This starter website does not include an account system, newsletter signup, or working contact form. If you email the site owner, the information in your message and email address will be used to respond to you.</p><h2>Automatically collected information</h2><p>The hosting provider or website infrastructure may process basic technical information such as IP address, browser type, requested page, and request time for security and operation. The exact data handling depends on the hosting provider’s policies.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This starter website does not intentionally install third-party analytics or advertising cookies. If analytics, advertising, embedded media, or affiliate tracking tools are added later, this policy must be updated to describe them accurately and provide any required choices or disclosures.</p><h2>Third-party websites</h2><p>Articles may link to external websites. We do not control the privacy practices or content of those sites. Review the privacy policy of each external service you choose to use.</p><h2>Children's privacy</h2><p>This website is intended as general educational content and is not designed to collect personal information from children.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the contact details on our <a href={`${base}contact/`}>Contact page</a>. Replace the placeholder contact address before publishing.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
